WEBVTT

1
00:00:10.667 --> 00:00:16.847
Ben: I love visiting the pet store.

2
00:00:16.848 --> 00:00:20.217
Theo: It's the perfect place for our club to meet.

3
00:00:20.218 --> 00:00:28.541
Sarah: Look at those cute kittens!

4
00:00:28.542 --> 00:00:31.597
Snooks: Ar-ooo!

5
00:00:31.598 --> 00:00:34.833
Ben: They have aquariums for turtles here.

6
00:00:34.834 --> 00:00:37.182
Skyler: And toys for parrots.

7
00:00:37.183 --> 00:00:43.304
Riley: Let's go inside.

8
00:00:43.305 --> 00:00:47.690
Kelli: Hurry up. I have to meet my boyfriend at the library.

9
00:00:47.691 --> 00:00:51.179
Chatter: Don't be late!

10
00:00:51.180 --> 00:00:55.918
Riley: I love the way the pet store smells.

11
00:00:55.919 --> 00:00:59.582
Sarah: Ahh . . . It smells like cat treats.

12
00:00:59.583 --> 00:01:02.679
Skyler: And birdseed.

13
00:01:02.680 --> 00:01:07.992
Ben: And turtle food!

14
00:01:07.993 --> 00:01:14.129
Riley: No, Snooks!

15
00:01:14.130 --> 00:01:16.642
Riley: I'm sorry, Mr. Lin.

16
00:01:16.643 --> 00:01:19.532
Riley: Snooks ate some dog treats.

17
00:01:19.533 --> 00:01:21.552
Mr. Lin: Don't worry, Riley.

18
00:01:21.553 --> 00:01:23.986
Snooks can have them.

19
00:01:23.987 --> 00:01:31.981
Mr. Lin: After all, next week is Pet Week.

20
00:01:31.982 --> 00:01:34.085
Sarah: It is?

21
00:01:34.086 --> 00:01:38.939
Mr. Lin: Yes. Pet Week is when everyone celebrates pets.

22
00:01:38.940 --> 00:01:44.912
Riley: The Pet Lovers Club celebrates pets every day!

23
00:01:44.913 --> 00:01:49.378
Theo: But let's do something special for Pet Week.

24
00:01:49.379 --> 00:01:51.883
Skyler: We could put on a pet show!

25
00:01:51.884 --> 00:01:55.924
Ben: Yeah! For kids in our neighborhood!

26
00:01:55.925 --> 00:01:59.008
Skyler: We'll show off our pets' newest tricks.

27
00:01:59.009 --> 00:02:03.225
Theo: We can have it in my backyard.

28
00:02:03.226 --> 00:02:05.821
Riley: What's the matter, Ben?

29
00:02:05.822 --> 00:02:09.163
Ben: Speedy doesn't know any tricks.

30
00:02:09.164 --> 00:02:11.991
Sarah: He's very pretty.

31
00:02:11.992 --> 00:02:16.023
Skyler: And he can stand still for hours.

32
00:02:16.024 --> 00:02:19.823
Riley: Snooks can't do that!

33
00:02:19.824 --> 00:02:22.349
Ben: But those aren't real tricks.

34
00:02:22.350 --> 00:02:24.208
I love Speedy.

35
00:02:24.209 --> 00:02:32.558
Ben: I just wish he could do something cool.
